  "comments": "<p>There are three main groups of the Obv.<br>Medium head: 1982-1987, 1994-1997, 2000, 2001.<br>Large head: 1988-1991.<br>Small head: 1991-1992, 1998.<br>Portrait varieties exist with the size of the head and details of hair and signature vary.<br><br><u>1982&nbsp;</u><br>Only medium head.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/59ca43d7dbb6c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/59ca43d7dbb6c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><u>1987</u><br>Only medium head.<br><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> 1982 - large signature, lower plies of hair narrow.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - small signature, well engraved front part of neck with sharp bottom corner, lower plies of hair wide.<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/639e362b8b039.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/639e362b8b039.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>Variations exist on 1987</p><p><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"width:22.06%;\" src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/65fee91dc088c.png\"><br><br><u>1991</u><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5c87b0251d00d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5c87b0251d00d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>Examples of 1991 with the monument edges incuse (compared to 1980s with the monument edges raised) are known:<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6342b750b698a.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6342b750b698a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>©tvladusic</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1991 - 1&amp;9 close and with gap</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/656b8b48bfe38.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/656b8b48bfe38.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1988 Overprint</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/656b8b865629b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/656b8b865629b.jpg\"></a></p>",
